{"ledger":"chemistry_exams","discipline":"chemistry","notes":["Granularity: unit/section names plus the named sub-headings of broad units (e.g. JEE's 'Organic Compounds Containing Oxygen' -> Alcohols/Phenols/Ethers, Aldehydes and Ketones, Carboxylic Acids); illustrative sub-bullets are not recorded. Bare discipline banners (Physical/Inorganic/Organic Chemistry) are not recorded as topic lines for JEE Main / NEET / JEE Advanced; GATE and CSIR numbered section units ARE recorded as lines.","GA exclusions: GATE General Aptitude (Section GA) and CSIR NET Part A general-aptitude lines are excluded per the register's rules; only chemistry subject topics are recorded.","JEE Advanced: jeeadv.ac.in was visited but is currently in its 2027 pre-announcement state (the syllabus.html URL serves scribe-services boilerplate; no syllabus page published, /archive.html only lists past papers); the syllabus has been unchanged since the 2023 revision, so two reputable mirrors were used — Vedantu (carries the syllabus verbatim) and Physics Wallah (corroborates the topic index). Both marked 'mirror'.","IB: ibo.org is Cloudflare-gated and unreachable from this environment (checked via HTTP and a headless browser); the official 2023 DP Chemistry structure (Structure 1-3 / Reactivity 1-3, first assessment 2025) was taken from the SaveMyExams mirror of the syllabus (marked 'mirror'). The Tools and Inquiry-process skills sections are consolidated into two summary lines rather than exploded.","NEET UG 2026 chemistry syllabus is unit-for-unit identical to the JEE Main chemistry syllabus (the same 20 NTA units); each is recorded under its own exam as the ledger requires.","CUET UG 2026 official PDF heads the domain as 'Chemistry - 306' (the domain code was 304 in earlier cycles).","IChO: Appendix C of the IChO Regulations (valid from 1 August 2023) exported from the official Google Doc linked at ichosc.org/regulations; the general-skilled lines (awareness of experimental errors/significant figures, secondary-school mathematics skills) are skipped as general aptitude, and the laboratory-skills register and the fields-of-advanced-difficulty example lists are consolidated into single summary lines.","AP Chemistry uses the College Board Course and Exam Description effective Fall 2024 (unit names differ from the pre-2024 CED); the science practices are skills, not topic lines.","A-levels: Cambridge 9701 syllabus for 2025-2027 (official PDF from cambridgeinternational.org); A Level-only repeats of AS topic names are suffixed '(A Level)'.","Re-derivation records 310 topic lines vs the original pass's 246 — the overshoot comes from the verbatim breadth of the JEE Advanced section list (37 lines), the Cambridge 9701 numbered topic list (37) and the IChO Appendix C knowledge list (55)."],"built":"2026-11-17","exams":[{"exam":"jee-main","sources":[{"url":"https://jeemain.nta.nic.in/document/syllabus-2026/","nature":"official"},{"url":"https://cdnbbsr.s3waas.gov.in/s3f8e59f4b2fe7c5705bf878bbd494ccdf/uploads/2025/10/202510311323551056.pdf","nature":"official"}],"lines":[{"topic":"Some Basic Concepts in Chemistry","book":"foundation-chemistry","score":1,"status":"direct"},{"topic":"Atomic Structure","book":"foundation-chemistry","score":1,"status":"direct"},{"topic":"Chemical Bonding and Molecular Structure","book":"quantum-chemistry","score":1,"status":"direct"},{"topic":"Chemical Thermodynamics","book":"physical-chemistry","score":1,"status":"direct"},{"topic":"Solutions","book":"foundation-chemistry","score":1,"status":"direct"},{"topic":"Equilibrium","book":"physical-chemistry","score":1,"status":"direct"},{"topic":"Redox Reactions and Electrochemistry","book":"physical-chemistry","score":0.67,"status":"direct"},{"topic":"Chemical Kinetics","book":"foundation-chemistry","score":1,"status":"direct"},{"topic":"Classification of Elements and Periodicity in Properties","book":"inorganic-chemistry","score":1,"status":"direct"},{"topic":"p-Block Elements","book":"inorgani